    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not about sitting still though. sitting still just makes the fog thicker. when i look at the edge, it doesn't feel scary, it just feels... quiet. like the only part of the story that actually makes sense. everything else has been so loud and messy, but the drop looks so calm. it feels like the natural end to the poem.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
